          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Perpendicular lines",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " are a pair of lines which intersect each other at right angles (90°). In Fig. 5.4, we can say that lines l and m are perpendicular to each other."
